Description: pavucontrol-like terminal mixer for PulseAudio and PipeWire
 pavucli is a curses mixer in the spirit of pavucontrol. It controls the
 volume, per-channel volume, balance and mute state of playback/recording
 streams and devices, moves streams between devices, selects ports, sets
 the default device and switches sound card profiles.
 .
 Works with PulseAudio and PipeWire (pipewire-pulse).
